{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"よし、俺の勝ちだな","trans":"好，是我赢了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800230010","name":"霧子","text":"おめでとう……\r\nございます……","trans":"恭喜……\n你……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800230020","name":"霧子","text":"……\r\n好きです……","trans":"……\n我喜欢你……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800230030","name":"霧子","text":"虜に……\r\nなっちゃいました……","trans":"已经……\n成了你的俘虏了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800230040","name":"霧子","text":"ずっと……\r\nここにいて……","trans":"一直……\n留在这里……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そ、それはちょっと\r\n難しいかもしれないな……","trans":"这、这个可能有点\n难办啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800230060","name":"霧子","text":"『告白』の……\r\n演技ですよ……","trans":"是“告白”的……\n演技哦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-17","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──！？！？　夢──……？","trans":"——！？！？　是梦——……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-20","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（────……やっぱり、\r\nここは正統派に、『告白』でいくのがいいかな……！）","trans":"（————……果然，\n这里还是走正统路线，选“告白”比较好吧……！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}